# power

Power enables to deliver the test resources out of a central database. To
generate the test data run `power`. Power creates the data out of a
compressed repository.

## action

generate test data:

    --books
    --dirty
    --docu
    --large
    --medium
    --negative
    --paper
    --small

## developer setup

```
cd ~/hoverpower
python3 -mvenv ~/.tmp/$(basename $PWD)
source ~/.tmp/$(basename $PWD)/bin/activate

pip install baw
baw sync all

pip install .[dev]

export HOVERPOWER_STORE=~/hoverpower/hoverpower/repo
# export HOVERPOWER_SECRET=

powerdecrypt

baw test all
```
